# The vite-react-tanstack profile: what a React single-page app built with Vite and TanStack
# (file-based Router, Query, Form) keeps in step. Opt in with `vite-react-tanstack` in the
# project's .template-profiles. Same syntax as .template/manifest, but every path is read
# from .template/profiles/vite-react-tanstack/ rather than from the template's root.
#
# Where the app is hosted is not part of it. A hosting profile (Cloudflare, GCP) is listed
# after this one and writes .devtools/host/: the shared configs here load its Vite plugin,
# Vitest projects, ESLint rules and make targets from there when it exists, so swapping
# hosts touches neither this profile nor the project's own config files nor src/.
#
# Per project, and not listed: package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml, vite.config.ts,
# vitest.config.ts, eslint.config.js, the tsconfig*.json at the root, index.html,
# .prettierignore and everything under src/. Each of those imports or extends the shared
# half in .devtools/vite/, and `node .devtools/scripts/gen.mjs app` writes a first version
# of all of them.
#
# In a pnpm workspace those files sit in the app's directory: set APP_DIR in .devtools/Makefile
# above `include vite.mk`, and list it under a packages: key above the block in
# pnpm-workspace.yaml. eslint.config.js, .prettierignore and a package.json for the shared
# tools stay at the root.
#
# Adding the profile to a project: `include vite.mk` from .devtools/Makefile, after
# base.mk, and remove the Makefile's own `clean` recipe. If the project already has the
# files the blocks below go in, wrap the lines that do the same job in the markers first;
# without them sync appends a second copy of each block.

file  .devtools/vite.mk
file  .devtools/vite/vite.ts
file  .devtools/vite/vitest.ts
file  .devtools/vite/eslint.js
file  .devtools/vite/tsconfig.base.json
file  .devtools/scripts/strings.mjs
file  .devtools/scripts/gen.mjs
file  .devtools/scripts/bundle-budget.mjs
file  .prettierrc.json
file  .github/workflows/ci.yml

block mise.toml               vite
block pnpm-workspace.yaml     vite
block lefthook.yml            vite
block .gitignore              vite
block .editorconfig           vite
block .github/dependabot.yml  vite
block AGENTS.md               vite
